abstract: "Open structured reference datasets (JSON/CSV) for Japan Cabinet Office national holidays (2024-2028) and JST Tenpo-reki lunar new moons (2019-2033), plus a zero-dependency ESM calculation engine for Rokuyo, Tenshanichi, Civil Code Art. 140 period counting, and business days (hizukekeisan.com)."
